cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "NTN LEO Satellite Routing Evaluation Data"
abstract: >-
  Raw evaluation data supporting the paper "Topological Forwarding for LEO
  Constellations: A Scope-Specific Routing Policy in a Recursive User-Plane
  Architecture". Contains forwarding-state, routing-update, route-instability,
  delivery, and path-stretch metrics for link-state, topological, and
  explicit-path routing families across four LEO constellations (Starlink,
  OneWeb, Kuiper, Telesat) under Ring and +Grid ISL regimes, generated with the
  LEOPath simulator.
type: dataset
